haviour of yours... i dont like it"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm sorry if my response felt off. I'll stay focused on what matters to you. What would you like to talk about?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Whatever io am feeling"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm sorry I shifted away from what matters to you. Let's stay focused on your experience. What are you feeling right now?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "exhaustion, physical illness (cold and fatigue), hopelessness, feeling unheard."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm sorry I didn't stay with you. You're not alone. What would help you feel heard right now?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "STaying with my emotions, not drfiting away, being a friend"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm here for you. You're not alone. What would help you feel supported right now?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "You know, when you feel that you just need to support yourself, you fight your family to alllow you to move back with your friends, and when you do, you feel maybe your friends dont care that much and you have to demand / ask everything, to feel included?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm here for you. You're not alone. What would help you feel supported right now?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Cant you hear what i say: You know, when you feel that you just need to support yourself, you fight your family to alllow you to move back with your friends, and when you do, you feel maybe your friends dont care that much and you have to demand / ask everything, to feel included? This is what i am feeling... is it valid?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm really sorry I didn't stay grounded in your feelings. You're right to feel frustrated. What you're describing is valid and real\u2014feeling like you have to fight for your needs to be met, even in the people you expect to support you, can be deeply exhausting and painful. It\u2019s okay to feel unheard, and it\u2019s okay to feel like you ha