    {
      "heading": "Preparation Steps",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Follow these steps to prepare idli batter and cook the idlis:"
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "1. Wash the rice and urad dal thoroughly.",
        "2. Soak the rice and urad dal separately in water for 4-6 hours or overnight.",
        "3. Drain the soaked rice and urad dal and grind them separately into smooth batters.",
        "4. Combine the rice batter and urad dal batter in a large container.",
        "5. Add salt to taste and mix well.",
        "6. Cover the batter and let it ferment for 8-10 hours or until it doubles in volume.",
        "7. Once fermented, add water to the batter to achieve a smooth and flowing consistency.",
        "8. Grease the idli plates and fill them with the batter.",
        "9. Steam the idlis in a pressure cooker or steamer for 10-12 minutes.",
