          ["3", "Let the dough rest for 10-15 minutes."],
          ["4", "Divide the dough into small equal portions and roll them into balls."],
          ["5", "Flatten each ball with your palm and roll it into a thin rotla using a rolling pin."],
          ["6", "Heat a tawa or griddle over medium heat. Place the rotla on it and cook until bubbles form and the bottom turns golden brown."],
